ECB mode leaks plaintext patterns because identical input blocks produce identical output blocks. Use authenticated AES-GCM instead.

Compliant AES-GCM snippet:
Cipher cipher = Cipher.getInstance("AES/GCM/NoPadding");
cipher.init(Cipher.ENCRYPT_MODE, secretKey, gcmSpec);

MD5 is susceptible to hash collision attacks. Upgrade to SHA-256 or SHA-512.

Compliant SHA-256 snippet:
MessageDigest digest = MessageDigest.getInstance("SHA-256");
byte[] hash = digest.digest(inputData.getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8));

