Use HTTPS with TLS 1.3 and HttpsURLConnection for all network communication.

Compliant HTTPS snippet:
URL url = new URL("https://api.example.com/v1/secure-endpoint");
HttpsURLConnection conn = (HttpsURLConnection) url.openConnection();

java.util.Random produces deterministic pseudo-random sequences. Use java.security.SecureRandom for security tokens and cryptographic operations.

Compliant SecureRandom snippet:
SecureRandom secureRandom = new SecureRandom();
byte[] tokenBytes = new byte[32];
secureRandom.nextBytes(tokenBytes);

MODE_WORLD_READABLE and MODE_WORLD_WRITEABLE allow any application on the device to read/modify app files. Use Context.MODE_PRIVATE or EncryptedFile.

Compliant file creation:
FileOutputStream fos = context.openFileOutput("sensitive_data.txt", Context.MODE_PRIVATE);

Use parameterized queries with selectionArgs to prevent SQL injection.

Compliant parameterized query snippet:
